                        "entry_id": "71be338d-bda8-30de-b5a0-840f105ca9e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An adherent of the teachings of early Christian theologian Tertullian (Quintus Septimius Florens Tertullianus; c.155-c.240 CE)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae2572b8-5f73-4021-bacd-fd3bb2e478ac",
                                "sense_id": "64261e51-431e-30c3-bc54-e6dfbc8a7689",
                                "text": "2007, William Tabbernee, Fake Prophecy and Polluted Sacraments: Ecclesiastical and Imperial Reactions to Montanism, Koninklijke Brill (Brill), page 268,\nEven Augustine's contact with the Tertullianists appears to have been slight. Could Augustine's assessment of the Tertullianists, therefore, have been inaccurate?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cfadadb-03bd-4dac-b26c-9a9fb0ab5f86",
                                "sense_id": "64261e51-431e-30c3-bc54-e6dfbc8a7689",
                                "text": "Christian learning must accordingly be Tertullianist learning. Tertullianist as well as Clementine — Clementine as well as Tertullianist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7af3542f-5ba6-4455-b619-f4041871cbe5",
                                "sense_id": "64261e51-431e-30c3-bc54-e6dfbc8a7689",
                                "text": "Augustine's indication that Tertullian himself founded the Tertullianists as a splinter group from the Carthaginian Montanists is unlikely. It is possible that the term ‘Tertullianist’ was a synonym for African Montanists, or that the Tertullianists were a sect within Carthaginian Montanism, or even that the Tertullianists did not identify themselves as Montanists at all."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
